sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Alice (browser)
    participant R as REST handler
    participant D as SQLite
    participant H as Hub
    participant B as Bob (WebSocket)
    A->>R: POST /api/channels/7/messages
    R->>R: check membership
    R->>D: INSERT message (FTS5 trigger indexes it)
    D-->>R: commit
    R-->>A: 200 {message}
    R->>H: broadcast message.new to channel members
    H-->>B: {"type":"message.new", ...}
